stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> InputParameters : User inputs Destination, Days, Budget, Theme, Pace
    InputParameters --> QueryLocalDataset : Backend matches queries in Local CSV
    QueryLocalDataset --> EnrichPrompt : Backend builds contextual AI prompt with CSV rows
    EnrichPrompt --> CallOpenRouter : Backend issues OkHttp call to OpenRouter API
    
    state AI_Check <<choice>>
    CallOpenRouter --> AI_Check
    
    AI_Check --> RenderItinerary : Success (Return AI Plan)
    AI_Check --> FallbackPlan : API Timeout / Failure (Build Local Fallback)
    
    FallbackPlan --> RenderItinerary : Return Fallback JSON
    RenderItinerary --> FetchWeatherAlerts : Retrieve concurrent weather & crowd alerts
    FetchWeatherAlerts --> DisplayToUser : Renders Plan, Weather, Budget, and Map View
    
    state Auth_Check <<choice>>
    DisplayToUser --> SaveTripAction : User clicks "Save Itinerary"
    SaveTripAction --> Auth_Check
    
    Auth_Check --> SaveToDatabase : Authenticated (POST to MySQL)
    Auth_Check --> RedirectLogin : Unauthenticated (Navigate to login.html)
    
    RedirectLogin --> SaveToDatabase : Login Success
    SaveToDatabase --> [*]
